#. front matter: title
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:2
msgid "【Ubuntu】公開鍵認証でSSH接続する方法"
msgstr "Connect to Ubuntu over SSH Using Public Key Authentication"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:12
msgid ""
"UbuntuにSSH接続する際、パスワード認証ではなく公開鍵認証を利用すると、セキュリ"
"ティを向上させることができます。本記事では、SSH公開鍵認証の設定方法を詳しく解"
"説します。"
msgstr ""
"When connecting to Ubuntu over SSH, using public key authentication instead "
"of password authentication can improve security. This article explains how "
"to configure SSH public key authentication."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:14
msgid "公開鍵と秘密鍵の生成"
msgstr "Generate a Public and Private Key Pair"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:16
msgid ""
"まずはクライアント側でSSH鍵を生成します。今回は鍵アルゴリズムED25519で作成し"
"ました。"
msgstr ""
"First, generate an SSH key pair on the client. In this example, the ED25519 "
"key algorithm is used."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:22
msgid ""
"SSH鍵の生成方法は以下のページで詳しく解説しています。参考にしてください。"
msgstr "The following page explains how to generate SSH keys in detail."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:24
msgid "[SSH鍵の生成方法](/blog/generate-ssh-key)"
msgstr "[How to Generate an SSH Key](/blog/generate-ssh-key)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:26
msgid ""
"上記コマンドを実行すると、秘密鍵と公開鍵が`~/.ssh/`ディレクトリに生成されま"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"When you run the command above, the private and public keys are generated in "
"the `~/.ssh/` directory."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:28
msgid "公開鍵をサーバーにコピー"
msgstr "Copy the Public Key to the Server"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:30
msgid "生成した公開鍵をSSHサーバーにコピーします。"
msgstr "Copy the public key you generated to the SSH server."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:36
msgid ""
"または、手動で公開鍵の内容をサーバーの`~/.ssh/authorized_keys`に追加すること"
"もできます。"
msgstr ""
"Alternatively, you can manually add the public key contents to the server's "
"`~/.ssh/authorized_keys` file."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:38
msgid "SSH設定の変更"
msgstr "Change the SSH Configuration"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:40
msgid ""
"セキュリティ向上のため、パスワードでのSSH接続を禁止し、公開鍵認証のみで接続で"
"きるようにします。"
msgstr ""
"For improved security, disable SSH connections using passwords so that "
"connections can be made only with public key authentication."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:42
msgid ""
"SSHの設定を変更するには、サーバーの`/etc/ssh/sshd_config`をテキストエディタで"
"編集します。以下の設定を確認・変更してください。"
msgstr ""
"To change the SSH configuration, edit the server's `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` "
"file with a text editor. Check and change the following settings."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:49
msgid "設定を反映させるため、SSHを再起動します。"
msgstr "Restart SSH to apply the changes."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:55
msgid "SSH接続の確認"
msgstr "Verify the SSH Connection"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:57
msgid "クライアントからSSH接続を試します。"
msgstr "Try connecting over SSH from the client."

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/ubuntu-ssh-key-access/index.md:63
msgid "ログインできれば、公開鍵認証の設定は完了です。"
msgstr "If you can log in, the public key authentication setup is complete."
